To apply the Ampere feature patches...

$ git clone https://git.code.sf.net/p/openocd/code openocd
$ cd openocd
$ git checkout fc566d74005a4aefbe125b9b2f777d9514c60c87
$ git am <path>/openocd/patches/*.patch
